### 9. Hotspot Create Voucher Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/user/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "vc_member_01",
  "password": "secretpassword",
  "profile": "default",
  "timelimit": "3h",
  "comment": "Dibuat via Universal Gateway"
}

### 9B. 🎟️ Hotspot Generate Batch Vouchers (Pipelined Mass Creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/generate-batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": 20,
  "prefix": "VIP-",
  "length": 6,
  "profile": "default",
  "timelimit": "1h",
  "comment": "Batch-Promo"
}

### 10. Hotspot Active Users (Sedang Online)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
