POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queues/simple
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 14. Universal Raw Command Runner (Perintah Bebas Apa Saja)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "router": {
    "host": "{{routerHost}}",
    "port": {{routerPort}},
    "user": "{{routerUser}}",
    "password": "{{routerPass}}"
  },
  "command": "/tool/ping",
  "args": {
    "address": "8.8.8.8",
    "count": "3"
  }
}

### 15. Realtime Traffic Streaming (SSE) - Buka di browser / SSE client
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/interfaces/stream?host={{routerHost}}&port={{routerPort}}&user={{routerUser}}&password={{routerPass}}&interface=ether1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 16. 🩺 Expert Quick Diagnose (Ping, DNS, Default Route, CPU Score)
